  nonce: '6804'  # 6804
  message: "Cross-ref 2026-11-01 (P2 review): INV-dosoz's ruby fixture shows the same double-emit - the analyzer's (wrong) `extends Q < A::B::X -> X@2` plus a linker-added `extends Q -> X@4` - so the invariant 'a base name the analyzer already resolved is not re-resolved by the linker' has a ruby instance too. The last-segment placeholder in the same chokepoint (_canonical_base_name -> _external_base_edge) is what gives WI-fivor its 'Base' and WI-tafum its 'JpaRepository'."  # 6804
